      444.39,
      542.48,
      591.53
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the annual Esala Festival of Sri Devol Maha Devalaya situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of Seenigama, Divisional Secretary's Division of Madampagama of the District of Galle, Southern Province, will be held during the period from Thursday the 1st of August, 2024 to Thursday the 08th of August, 2024 as per the order made under the Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 1965/39 dated 06.05.2016 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka in terms of Section 2 of the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Cap.175). W. A. Dharmasiri, District Secretary/Government Agent, Administrative District, Galle. at the District Secretariat, Galle,24th of June, 2024.",
